This package is an independent Haskell implementation that reproduces the
observable behaviour of the pinned Petrus Python reference (see UPSTREAM.md
at the repository root). Its SQL statements, task payload spelling, failure
reason shape, and error messages are reproduced from that reference so that
both implementations share one Absurd schema and one set of queues. The
driver scripts in test/interop and bench run the reference itself from the
pinned upstream virtual environment.

